# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets — NEVER commit these
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Kiro MCP config holds a live Google OAuth bearer token (Stitch) +
# other credentials. Keep it local only.
.kiro/settings/mcp.json
**/mcp.json

# Environment / credential files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.keystore
*.jks
credentials.json
service-account*.json
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist

